- **Minimum** ($P=\tfrac13$): Original triangle collinear with $\beta$ between $\alpha,\gamma$: $a=\tfrac16, b=\tfrac13, c=\tfrac12$. Set $\Delta$ between $\varepsilon,\zeta$ with $x=\tfrac16$. Permute so $\theta=\Delta$, giving $p=q=\tfrac16$. Set $\kappa=\mu$ (so $y=0$). Perimeter $= \tfrac16+\tfrac16+0=\tfrac13$. ✓
